# mcp 2.x is a breaking rename: `mcp.server.fastmcp.FastMCP` became
# `mcp.server.mcpserver.MCPServer`, so an unbounded `mcp[cli]` resolves to a
# release this server cannot import. Keep the upper bound until the server is
# ported. The lower bound is the floor that carries the PYSEC-2026-3481/3482
# fixes.
mcp[cli]>=1.27.2,<2
pydantic>=2.0
